        "language": "english",
        "review": "Honestly, I picked up this game because I’m a huge fan of games like Kamla and Pacify, and this totally hits the spot. The atmosphere is super creepy, and I love how the game keeps you guessing with its puzzles. Some of them really made me stop and think!\r\n\r\nI haven’t finished it yet (it’s tougher than I expected!), but that’s actually a good thing—it’s not one of those games you breeze through in an hour. For the price, it’s absolutely worth it. If you like intense horror games with a good dose of puzzles, I totally recommend giving The Museum a try!",
